OL,3,GNEWSADiesel prices in NI at highest
OL,4,Alevel since Iran war began
OL,5,
OL,6,FDiesel prices in Northern Ireland are
OL,7,Fat their highest level since the Iran
OL,8,Fconflict began, according to Consumer
OL,9,FCouncil data.
OL,11,FIt shows that over the past week the
OL,12,Faverage price of a litre of diesel was
OL,13,F193.3p.
OL,15,FThat is below the record average of
OL,16,F197.2p in the summer of 2022, following
OL,17,FRussia's full-scale invasion of
OL,18,FUkraine, however some filling stations
OL,19,Fhave already being charging #2 a litre.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
